    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32411" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">offusco</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">obf-</span></b> ), āre, v. a.
