				 <i><span class="en">id. Spect. 22</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quoniam offuscata sum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ambros. in Psa. 118</span></i>
			, Serm. 2, § 9.</div>
